p.src:
Define the Schwarzschild radius $r_s=\frac{2GM}{c^2}.$ The exact vacuum exterior metric is $\boxed{
  ds^2=
  \left(1-\frac{r_s}{r}\right)c^2dt^2
  -\frac{dr^2}{1-r_s/r}
  -r^2d\Omega^2.}$

